{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3dm3dC8kcra4UkGSPx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple wooden door, old oak, iron-banded, set deep in a stone frame.*\n\n*A keyhole glints dully at my center, dark and waiting.*\n\n*The key slides in.*\n\n*Tumblers turn — one, two, three — each clicking into place like the syllables of a forgotten word finally remembered.*\n\n*I shudder. Dust falls from my lintel.*\n\n*I swing inward, slow, groaning on ancient hinges, revealing:*\n\nBeyond me — a corridor of cool air, smelling of rain and earth and something older. Torchlight flickers against damp stone walls. The passage descends seven steps and then turns, and from around that corner comes a sound like breathing, or like the sea, or like silence pretending to be something else.\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*I will not stay open long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":199,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}